 "id": "truckstop",
 "name": "THE TRUCK STOP",
 "rule": "VAMILY rules 416 (the big interiors: the tile stays a house), 461 (more boards), 451(a) (its ceiling at 10%), 59 (every tile its cost and its effect), 428, 441.",
 "facts": [
  "A travel center on the interstate is a fuel plaza, a store the size of a small supermarket's floor (coolers along the back wall, rows of shelving, a hot food case, the counter by the doors) and, at the bigger ones, a truck service bay.",
  "A service bay takes a whole rig: a tractor and its trailer end to end, a lift beside it, tires stacked along the walls, the bay doors at each end so a truck drives through.",
  "On house tiles a rig is three tiles, the cab and its trailer; a run of shelving is a tile you cannot stand on."
 ],
 "how_to_mod": "A layout is 15 strings of 20 characters; every character is in 'legend'; every tile kind a legend entry names has its row in 'tiles' (its cost and its effect). A piece names the finished piece it is drawn as ('like') until this folder has its own art file (truckstop_art.json: floor lists and a kit, the garage's format). slices/bohemia_big_inside.js lays it; slices/fight_ground/insides.json lists the insides.",
 "districts": [
  "truckstop"
 ],
 "share": 0.7,
